//   https://www.faa.gov/regulations_policies/handbooks_manuals/aviation/faa-h-8083-25c.pdf
// Aviation Weather Handbook, FAA-H-8083-28B: a TAF covers 5 SM from the center of the runway complex; PROB30 is a 30 percent chance of
