// Private Pilot Airplane ACS, FAA-S-ACS-6C, PA.I.D (K1 to K6, R1 to R7, S1 to S5) and PA.VI.A to VI.D:
//   https://www.faa.gov/training_testing/testing/acs/private_airplane_acs_6.pdf
// Airports, AirNav (FAA information effective 01 October 2026): https://www.airnav.com/airport/KAPA , https://www.airnav.com/airport/KGXY ,
//   https://www.airnav.com/airport/KCFO
//   KAPA 39-34-12.4270N 104-50-57.4550W, 5,884.9 ft, towered; remark "Advise ground control when ready for departure. Ground control will advise
